ptured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sections are hidden unless NEXT_PUBLIC_WWW_HIDE_EXPANSION_SECTIONS is exactly 'false'; hides page routes (not-found), removes header/footer links, and removes sitemap entries. Caution against flipping to false in production before content work completes, since hidden pages still use placeholder data."}, {"id": "www_technical_documentation_hiddenroutes", "label": "Hidden Routes (businesses/careers/life-at-sn)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "www/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "www_technical_documentation_atsprocessing", "label": "ATS Event via Inngest", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "www/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Event is sent only when INNGEST_EVENT_KEY is set and is non-blocking; a failure of the event does not stop the application flow."}, {"id": "www_technical_documentation_dbmigrate", "label": "pnpm db:migrate (Remote Migration Caution)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "www/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pnpm db:migrate pushes migrations to whatever Supabase project the CLI is linked to, which can be production; confirm the linked project before running it. For local-only verification use 'pnpm exec supabase db push --local --workdir .' instead."}, {"id": "www_technical_documentation_servicerolekey", "label": "SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY Risk", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "www/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The admin Supabase client does not obey RLS; a leak of SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY gives full database access, so it must stay in server environments only."}, {"id": "www_technical_documentation_sharedschema", "label": "Shared Supabase Schema Risk", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "www/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "apps/www and apps/web use one Supabase schema, so a migration for one application can affect the other application."}, {"id": "www_technical_documentation_placeholderdata", "label": "Placeholder Content Risk", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "www/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Parts of the website use src/data/placeholder.ts; hidden sections depend on this placeholder data and it must be replaced with real data before a hidden section is shown."}, {"id": "www_technical_documentation_vercelconfigsplit", "label": "Vercel Configuration Split Risk", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "www/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The root vercel.json belongs to the public website; apps/web/vercel.json belongs to the HR portal; these configurations must not be mixed."}, {"id": "www_technical_documentation_localsupabasestack", "label": "Local Supabase Stack (ports 55321-55324)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "www/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "www_technical_documentation_handoverdoc", "target": "www_technical_documentation_astste100", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "www/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "www_technical_documentation_handoverdoc", "target": "www_technica